#     SAVED IN THE CASE. This script used to OVERWRITE those with PF_ITMXN/PF_ACCN/PF_TOLN/...
#     right before solving -- so even with identical option flags it was NOT running the same
#     FDNS the GUI runs, which is why it hunted where the GUI converges.
#     True  = do NOT call solution_parameters_4; inherit the case's own parameters -> identical
#             to the GUI solve.  (default -- this is "just maintain the GUI settings")
